      "content": "it's not like a friend can just fix it though. there's no \"help\" for this. nothing changes. i wake up, i do everything for them, i go to bed, and i do it all again tomorrow. it's just a lifetime of being exhausted and wanting to disappear. sometimes i just stare at the wall and think about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to be here anymore. if things just... stopped.",
